 table of values:\n\n| **$t$** | $0$ | $1$ | $2$ | $3$ | $4$ | $5$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $x$ | $4$ | $\\frac{65}{12}$ | {{field-1}} | $\\frac{51}{4}$ | {{field-3}} | $\\frac{313}{12}$ |\n| $y$ | $-4$ | $- \\frac{29}{12}$ | $- \\frac{1}{3}$ | {{field-2}} | $\\frac{16}{3}$ | $\\frac{107}{12}$ |" :question/worked-solution "- To find the value of $x(2),$ we substitute $t=2$ into $$\n\\displaystyle x=\\frac{3 t^{2}}{4} + \\frac{2 t}{3} + 4.\n$$ This gives\n\n$$\nx(2)=\\frac{3 (2)^{2}}{4} + \\frac{2 (2)}{3} + 4=(4)+\\left(\\frac{4}{3}\\right)+(3)=\\frac{25}{3}.\n$$\n\n- To find the value of $y(3),$ we substitute $t=3$ into $y=\\frac{t^{2}}{4} + \\frac{4 t}{3} - 4.$ This gives\n\n$$\ny(3)=\\frac{(3)^{2}}{4} + \\frac{4 (3)}{3} - 4=(-4)+\\left(\\frac{9}{4}\\right)+(4)=\\frac{9}{4}.\n$$\n\n- To find the value of $x(4),$ we substitute $t=4$ into $$\n\\displaystyle x=\\frac{3 t^{2}}{4} + \\frac{2 t}{3} + 4.\n$$ This gives\n\n$$\nx(4)=\\frac{3 (4)^{2}}{4} + \\frac{2 (4)}{3} + 4=(4)+\\left(\\frac{8}{3}\\right)+(12)=\\frac{56}{3}.\n$$\n\nThen the table is\n\n| **$t$** | $0$ | $1$ | $2$ | $3$ | $4$ | $5$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $x$ | $4$ | $\\frac{65}{12}$ | $\\frac{25}{3}$ | $\\frac{51}{4}$ | $\\frac{56}{3}$ | $\\frac{313}{12}$ |\n| $y$ | $-4$ | $- \\frac{29}{12}$ | $- \\frac{1}{3}$ | $\\frac{9}{4}$ | $\\frac{16}{3}$ | $\\frac{107}{12}$ |"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186557649 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4315c1ff-ffd7-588d-8cad-759c7a46b437" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{46}{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557644}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "4315c1ff-ffd7-588d-8cad-759c7a46b437" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{46}{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557644} :answer-field/id #uuid "4c6f52c7-bcfe-58f1-aa24-71f8de81c715" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/ty